ormation Collection​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may collect the following types of information in accordance with the principles of legality and necessity:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information you actively provide when registering an account, submitting forms, or using specific services, including but not limited to your name, email address, phone number, contact address, etc.;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Behavioral data generated during your use of the website, such as pages visited, duration of stay, click records, device model, browser type, IP address, geographic location (only with your authorization);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Information collected through Cookies and similar technologies (such as web beacons, local storage). Such information is used to identify users, optimize page display, and provide personalized services. You can manage or disable Cookies through browser settings, but this may affect the use of some functions.​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>3. Information Use​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The personal information we collect will be strictly used for the following purposes and will not exceed the necessary scope:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Providing, maintaining, and optimizing website services to ensure the normal operation of services;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Personalizing your user experience, such as recommending relevant content or adjusting page display based on your preferences;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sending important notifications, including but not limited to changes in service terms, account security reminders, and function update notifications;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Providing customer support, responding to your inquiries, complaints, or needs, and resolving problems encountered during use;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Preventing fraud, ensuring account security, identifying and handling unauthorized use, and maintaining the normal operation order of the website;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sending service-related marketing information with your explicit consent (you can unsubscribe at any time).​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4. Information Sharing​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We will not disclose, sell, or rent your personal information to any third party unless it falls into the following legal or agreed circumstances:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sharing with partners who assist us in operating the website or providing services (such as server hosting providers, payment service providers, customer service system providers, etc.). However, such partners must sign a confidentiality agreement, committing to use the information only for the purpose of performing services and adopting corresponding security protection measures;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Providing personal information as required by laws, regulations, judicial organs, or administrative supervision departments;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Disclosing information within a reasonable and necessary scope to protect our legitimate rights and interests, user interests, or public interests (such as responding to cyber attacks, handling infringement acts, etc.);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Transferring personal information in accordance with legal provisions during major business changes such as company merger, acquisition, asset transfer, or bankruptcy liquidation, and the transferee must continue to comply with the requirements of this Privacy Policy.​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>5. Information Protection​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We adopt industry-standard technical and management measures to ensure the security of personal information:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Technical aspect: Adopting data encryption, access permission control, firewall, security audit, and other technologies to prevent unauthorized access, tampering, or disclosure of information;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Management aspect: Establishing an information security management system, restricting internal personnel\'s access to personal information, and conducting regular security training and risk assessment;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Reminder: Although we have taken sufficient protection measures, there are inherent risks in Internet transmission. We cannot guarantee absolute security of information transmission. If you find any account abnormality, please contact us immediately.​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>6. Your Rights​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In accordance with relevant laws and regulations, you have the following rights regarding your personal information, and we will provide necessary assistance for you to exercise these rights:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right of access: Request to check and obtain your personal information and information usage at any time;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right of correction: Request us to correct or supplement your personal information if it is incorrect or incomplete;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right of deletion: Request to delete your personal information when legal conditions are met (such as the purpose of information collection has been achieved, you withdraw consent, etc.);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right to restrict use: Request to restrict or suspend our use of personal information (such as when questioning the accuracy of information);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right to withdraw consent: If you have previously agreed to our use of specific information, you can withdraw your consent at any time (but this does not affect the legal use that has occurred before the withdrawal);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Right to complain: If you believe that our information processing violates legal provisions, you can complain to the regulatory authorities.​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To exercise the above rights, please contact us through the method specified in the \"Contact Us\" section of this Policy. We will reply with the processing result within 15 working days.​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>7. Policy Updates​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time in accordance with changes in laws and regulations, business adjustments, or user needs:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The updated Policy will be published in a prominent position on the website (such as the bottom of the homepage) and marked with the \"Last Updated Date\";​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>If the updated content involves major changes to rights and interests (such as expansion of information collection scope, adjustment of sharing rules, etc.), we will notify you in advance through website pop-ups, emails, etc., to ensure you are aware of the changes;​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It is recommended that you review this Policy regularly. Your continued use of the website services shall be deemed as acceptance of the updated Policy.​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>8. Contact Us​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you have any questions, suggestions, or complaints about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us through the following methods:​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Email: <a href=\"mailto:privacy@example.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">privacy@example.com</a> (9:00-18:00 on working days, reply within 24 hours);​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact Address: [Please fill in your specific address, e.g., Room XX, Building XX, XX Road, XX District, XX City];​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Contact Phone: [Please fill in your contact phone number, e.g., 400-XXXX-XXXX].​</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last Updated: September 13, 2025​</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Privacy Policy','','publish','closed','closed','','privacypolicy-en','','','2025-09-13 00:51:19','2025-09-12 16:51:19','',0,'http://localhost/?page_id=132',0,'page','',0),(141,1,'2025-09-10 23:01:42','2025-09-10 15:01:42','跨境真空吸附手机车载支撑架汽车内饰导航支架稳定吸盘式支架','跨境真空吸附手机车载支撑架汽车内饰导航支架稳定吸盘式支架','','publish','open','closed','','phoneholder','','','2025-09-13 12:11:16','2025-09-13 04:11:16','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&#038;p=141',0,'product','',0),(142,1,'2025-09-10 23:08:22','2025-09-10 15:08:22','','跨境真空吸附手机车载支撑架汽车内饰导航支架稳定吸盘式支架 - 黑, 陶瓷玻璃','颜色: 黑, 材质: 陶瓷玻璃','publish','closed','closed','','%e8%b7%a8%e5%a2%83%e7%9c%9f%e7%a9%ba%e5%90%b8%e9%99%84%e6%89%8b%e6%9c%ba%e8%bd%a6%e8%bd%bd%e6%94%af%e6%92%91%e6%9e%b6%e6%b1%bd%e8%bd%a6%e5%86%85%e9%a5%b0%e5%af%bc%e8%88%aa%e6%94%af%e6%9e%b6%e7%a8%b3','','','2025-09-10 23:37:37','2025-09-10 15:37:37','',141,'http://localhost/?post_type=product_variation&#038;p=142',3,'product_variation','',0),(143,1,'2025-09-10 23:12:20','2025-09-10 15:12:20','','跨境真空吸附手机车载支撑架汽车内饰导航支架稳定吸盘式支架 - 白, 不锈钢','颜色: 白, 材质: 不锈钢','publish','closed','closed','','%e8%b7%a8%e5%a2%83%e7%9c%9f%e7%a9%ba%e5%90%b8%e9%99%84%e6%89%8b%e6%9c%ba%e8%bd%a6%e8%bd%b