层刺激的推力和振动假阳具:6英寸可插入长度和5英寸周长,按摩G点和肌肉。 包括 10 个推力和振动,为您找到完美的设置</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">【适合身体使用的硅胶】防水・充电式成人玩具:由防水硅胶制成,触感丝滑。 这款 USB 可充电女性情趣玩具适合在淋浴或浴缸中使用。 易于清洁,无需电池</span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-list-item\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">有趣的亲密惊喜选择:与爱人、妻子或朋友分享这款令人惊讶的双端假阳具振动棒。 非常适合在节日、生日或单身派对上宠爱每一个人。 这款奶嘴玩具是任何性玩具收藏品的绝佳补充</span></span></span></li>\r\n 	<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">保密的包装和安静操作:性爱机器包装谨慎,没人会知道您的送货箱里有什么。 性玩具采用降噪技术,因此在工作时,噪音小于 50 分贝</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>','女性振动器假阳具性玩具','','inherit','closed','closed','','231-autosave-v1','','','2025-09-13 21:07:55','2025-09-13 13:07:55','',231,'http://localhost/?p=282',0,'revision','',0),(283,1,'2025-09-13 21:10:10','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','','','2025-09-13 21:10:10','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&p=283',0,'product','',0),(284,1,'2025-09-13 21:25:36','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','','','2025-09-13 21:25:36','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&p=284',0,'product','',0),(285,1,'2025-09-13 21:35:23','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','','','2025-09-13 21:35:23','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&p=285',0,'product','',0),(286,1,'2025-09-13 22:17:40','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','','','2025-09-13 22:17:40','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&p=286',0,'product','',0),(287,1,'2025-09-13 22:31:31','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','','','2025-09-13 22:31:31','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'http://localhost/?post_type=product&p=287',0,'product','',0),(288,1,'2025-09-13 22:35:46','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','AUTO-DRAFT','','auto-draft','open','closed','','','